---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { IMPACT } from "../consts";

const pageTitle = IMPACT.TITLE;
const pageDescription = IMPACT.DESCRIPTION;
---

<PageLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  
  <section class="animate font-sans text-black dark:text-white max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-32 pb-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Community & Impact</h1>
    <p class="mb-10 opacity-75 leading-relaxed">
      Beyond writing code, I am passionate about bridging the gap between technology and people. 
      From mentoring global finalists at Google to creating educational content accessed by hundreds of thousands.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-12">

      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 pl-6 py-2">
        <span class="absolute -left-[9px] top-3 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-black dark:bg-white"></span>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Google Solution Challenge Mentor</h2>
          <span class="text-sm font-mono opacity-60">Jan 2024</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold opacity-80 mb-3">Google Developers • Global Finals</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 opacity-75 text-sm md:text-base">
          <li>Invited by Google to serve as a <strong>Technical Mentor </strong> for the teams shortlisted for Global Finals.</li>
          <li>Guided <strong>10+ shortlisted student teams</strong> on scalable architecture and cloud integration.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 pl-6 py-2">
        <span class="absolute -left-[9px] top-3 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 dark:bg-neutral-600"></span>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Viral Educational Content</h2>
          <span class="text-sm font-mono opacity-60">2021 - Present</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold opacity-80 mb-3">GeeksForGeeks • YouTube</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 opacity-75 text-sm md:text-base mb-4">
          <li>Authored the <strong>"Django Login System"</strong> tutorial on the GeeksForGeeks channel.</li>
          <li>Achieved <strong>700,000+ views</strong> with organic growth.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="w-full max-w-[480px] aspect-video rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800">
          <iframe 
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1UvTNMH7zDo" 
            title="Django Login Tutorial" 
            frameborder="0" 
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" 
            allowfullscreen>
          </iframe>
        </div>
        </div>

      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 pl-6 py-2">
        <span class="absolute -left-[9px] top-3 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 dark:bg-neutral-600"></span>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Google DSC Lead</h2>
          <span class="text-sm font-mono opacity-60">2021 - 2022</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold opacity-80 mb-3">IIIT Vadodara</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 opacity-75 text-sm md:text-base">
          <li>Led a community of <strong>75+ students</strong> and hosted 20+ workshops.</li>
          <li>Invited to exclusive <strong>Google Round-Table Meetups</strong> in Ahmedabad.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="relative border-l-2 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 pl-6 py-2">
        <span class="absolute -left-[9px] top-3 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 dark:bg-neutral-600"></span>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Microsoft Learn Student Ambassador</h2>
          <span class="text-sm font-mono opacity-60">2020 - 2022</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold opacity-80 mb-3">Microsoft (Beta Level)</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 opacity-75 text-sm md:text-base">
          <li>Mentored students on the Microsoft/GitHub tech ecosystem.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>